    {
      "example": "All",
      "help_en": "The state of the transcoding job. Default value: All. Valid values:\n\nAll\nSubmitted\nTranscoding\nTranscodeSuccess\nTranscodeFail\nTranscodeCancelled",
      "help_zh": "转码任务状态。默认为All（所有状态）。可取值：\n\nAll：所有状态。\nSubmitted：作业已提交。\nTranscoding：转码中。\nTranscodeSuccess：转码成功。\nTranscodeFail：转码失败。\nTranscodeCancelled：转码取消",
